1
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:10,100
Umer: Uff... subah ke chhe baj gaye!

2
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:21,100
Umer: Chalo Umer, uth jao — aaj safar ka din hai!

3
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:30,100
Umer: Assalam o Alaikum dosto! Main hoon Umer, aur yeh hai Ab Travel Splash.

4
00:00:30,300 --> 00:00:33,900
Umer: Aaj hum Karachi se Islamabad ja rahe hain — bohat khaas din hai!

5
00:00:34,100 --> 00:00:37,100
Umer: Lekin pehle... daant saaf karte hain!

6
00:00:58,100 --> 00:01:01,100
Umer: Daant saaf, din saaf! Ab packing ka time.

7
00:01:04,100 --> 00:01:08,100
Umer: Ammi! Ammi! Mera bag nikaal dein, please!

8
00:01:09,900 --> 00:01:12,900
Ammi: Aa rahi hoon beta! Yeh lo tumhara bag.

9
00:01:15,500 --> 00:01:19,100
Umer: Shukriya Ammi! Aur meri blue shirt kahan hai?

10
00:01:19,500 --> 00:01:23,500
Ammi: Almari mein hai beta — sab istri karke rakha hai.

11
00:01:35,500 --> 00:01:39,100
Ammi: Charger aur dawai bhi rakh lena!

12
00:01:41,500 --> 00:01:44,500
Umer: Ji Ammi, sab rakh liya!

13
00:01:51,500 --> 00:01:55,100
Umer: Packing mukammal! Ab chacha ko phone karta hoon.

14
00:01:58,500 --> 00:02:03,900
Umer: Hello chacha, Assalam o Alaikum! Revo le kar aa jayein — aath baje nikalna hai.

15
00:02:04,300 --> 00:02:08,500
Driver: Walaikum Assalam Umer bhai! Bas aadhe ghante mein pohanch raha hoon.

16
00:02:08,900 --> 00:02:10,900
Umer: Theek hai, shukriya!

17
00:02:16,500 --> 00:02:20,100
Ammi: Araam se khao beta, garam garam paratha hai.

18
00:02:21,500 --> 00:02:25,900
Umer: Ammi, aap ke haath ka paratha — iska koi jawab nahi!

19
00:02:27,500 --> 00:02:32,500
Ammi: Safar mein apna khayal rakhna, aur pohanch kar phone karna.

20
00:02:33,100 --> 00:02:35,500
Umer: Ji Ammi, InshaAllah.

21
00:02:43,900 --> 00:02:46,900
Umer: Lagta hai chacha aa gaye!

22
00:02:47,500 --> 00:02:51,900
Ammi: Fi Amanillah beta — Allah ki amaan mein.

23
00:03:02,600 --> 00:03:04,700
Umer: Assalam o Alaikum dosto! Main hoon Umer.

24
00:03:04,700 --> 00:03:06,500
Umer: Ab Travel Splash ke Episode 1 mein khush aamdeed!

25
00:03:06,900 --> 00:03:08,300
Driver: Walaikum Assalam, Umer bhai! Saman mujhe de dein.

26
00:03:08,300 --> 00:03:09,100
Umer: Shukriya chacha!

27
00:03:09,500 --> 00:03:12,500
Umer: Aaj ka safar — Karachi se Islamabad. Chalo, airport chalte hain!

28
00:03:13,700 --> 00:03:16,100
Ammi: Allah Hafiz beta, Fi Amanillah!

29
00:03:24,100 --> 00:03:27,300
Umer: Karachi ki subah — har taraf rush hi rush!

30
00:03:28,100 --> 00:03:32,300
Umer: Dekhiye dosto, Karachi mein sab apni left side par chalte hain.

31
00:03:35,100 --> 00:03:38,500
Driver: Signal laal hai, Umer bhai — zara rukte hain.

32
00:03:38,900 --> 00:03:42,700
Umer: Zebra crossing par log guzar rahe hain — bilkul theek!

33
00:03:47,100 --> 00:03:51,100
Umer: Woh dekhiye — Karachi Circular Railway ki train!

34
00:03:55,700 --> 00:04:00,500
Umer: Har taraf Aprox AI, Aprox Technology aur Next Group ke banners!

35
00:04:06,500 --> 00:04:09,500
Driver: Arey! Yeh bonnet se dhuaan kyun nikal raha hai?

36
00:04:10,100 --> 00:04:13,100
Umer: Chacha, gaari kinare par laga dein!

37
00:04:19,500 --> 00:04:23,500
Driver: Umer bhai, radiator garam ho gaya hai — paani khatam!

38
00:04:24,500 --> 00:04:29,100
Umer: Yaar yeh kya ho gaya! Main late ho raha hoon — meri flight nikal jayegi!

39
00:04:30,100 --> 00:04:34,500
Driver: Fikar na karein, paas hi ek workshop hai. Dheere dheere le chalte hain.

40
00:04:35,500 --> 00:04:40,500
Umer: Dosto, dekh rahe hain? Safar mein kuch bhi ho sakta hai... dua karein!

41
00:04:50,700 --> 00:04:54,700
Umer: Ustad ji, jaldi kijiye please — meri flight ka time ho raha hai!

42
00:04:55,300 --> 00:04:59,900
Mechanic: Bas paanch minute sahib. Radiator ka pipe leak tha — naya laga raha hoon.

43
00:05:04,100 --> 00:05:08,100
Umer: Dosto, sach mein tension ho rahi hai... ghari dekhte reh jao!

44
00:05:09,100 --> 00:05:12,500
Driver: Umer bhai, waqt hai abhi — pareshan na hon.

45
00:05:16,700 --> 00:05:19,500
Mechanic: Lo ji, gaari bilkul theek!

46
00:05:19,900 --> 00:05:22,700
Umer: Shukriya ustad ji! Kitne paise?

47
00:05:22,900 --> 00:05:24,900
Mechanic: Bas aath sau rupay.

48
00:05:25,100 --> 00:05:28,100
Umer: Yeh lijiye. Chalo chacha, jaldi airport!

49
00:05:29,100 --> 00:05:32,500
Umer: Dosto, gaari theek ho gayi — ab full speed airport!

50
00:05:35,700 --> 00:05:39,100
Umer: Dua karein flight na nikle!

51
00:05:39,700 --> 00:05:43,700
Driver: Fikar na karein Umer bhai, bas das minute mein airport!

52
00:05:59,100 --> 00:06:02,500
Guard: Assalam o Alaikum. Ticket aur shanakhti card dikhayein.

53
00:06:02,900 --> 00:06:05,900
Umer: Yeh lijiye — Karachi se Islamabad, aaj ki flight.

54
00:06:06,700 --> 00:06:09,700
Guard: Theek hai. Gaari ki checking hogi.

55
00:06:16,700 --> 00:06:19,100
Guard: Sab theek hai — jaayein!

56
00:06:21,100 --> 00:06:25,700
Umer: Dosto, departure upar hai aur arrival neeche — hum upar ja rahe hain!

57
00:06:30,700 --> 00:06:34,700
Umer: Woh raha Jinnah International Airport!

58
00:06:41,300 --> 00:06:43,300
Driver: Allah Hafiz Umer bhai, safar mubarak!

59
00:06:43,300 --> 00:06:44,700
Umer: Allah Hafiz chacha, shukriya!

60
00:06:44,900 --> 00:06:46,500
Umer: Chalein dosto — check-in karte hain.

61
00:06:51,500 --> 00:06:53,300
Agent: Assalam o Alaikum! Aap ka CNIC aur ticket, please.

62
00:06:53,400 --> 00:06:54,900
Agent: Yeh rahi aap ki boarding pass. Safar mubarak!

63
00:06:54,900 --> 00:06:56,500
Umer: Bohat shukriya!

64
00:06:58,700 --> 00:07:00,900
Umer: Camera tray mein — security check zaroori hai.

65
00:07:06,700 --> 00:07:08,100
Umer: Camera wapas mil gaya! Ab gate ki taraf.

66
00:07:17,100 --> 00:07:20,500
Umer: Ek burger, fries aur ek chai, please.

67
00:07:20,900 --> 00:07:23,500
Staff: Ji sir, abhi lijiye!

68
00:07:29,100 --> 00:07:32,500
Bilal: Arey Umer! Tum bhi Islamabad ja rahe ho?

69
00:07:32,900 --> 00:07:37,700
Umer: Haan yaar! Raaste mein gaari kharab ho gayi thi, bas abhi pohancha hoon.

70
00:07:38,100 --> 00:07:41,700
Hamza: Shukar hai pohanch gaye! Chalo, araam se nashta karo.

71
00:07:42,500 --> 00:07:45,700
Umer: Yeh burger to zabardast hai, yaar!

72
00:07:49,100 --> 00:07:57,100
Announcement: Mohtaram musafiron, Islamabad jane wali parwaz ki boarding shuru ho chuki hai. Baraye meharbani gate ki taraf tashreef le jayen. Shukriya.

73
00:07:57,700 --> 00:08:00,500
Umer: Chalo yaar, boarding shuru!

74
00:08:08,700 --> 00:08:11,700
Umer: Boarding shuru ho gayi — gate ki taraf chalte hain!

75
00:08:14,100 --> 00:08:17,700
Umer: Yeh jet bridge seedha jahaz ke darwaze tak jata hai.

76
00:08:24,700 --> 00:08:27,700
Umer: Boarding ho gayi — ab runway ki taraf!

77
00:08:29,500 --> 00:08:32,500
Umer: Takeoff... Bismillah!

78
00:08:47,100 --> 00:08:49,700
Umer: Dekhiye dosto — baadalon ke upar kya nazara hai!

79
00:08:52,400 --> 00:08:54,700
Umer: Karachi peeche reh gaya — Islamabad ab zyada door nahi.

80
00:08:54,700 --> 00:08:57,100
Umer: Thori der mein landing hogi, InshaAllah!

81
00:08:57,500 --> 00:09:00,700
Umer: Islamabad aa gaya! Peeche Margalla Hills dekhiye.

82
00:09:02,100 --> 00:09:04,700
Umer: Smooth landing — Alhamdulillah!

83
00:09:06,600 --> 00:09:10,200
Umer: Islamabad pohanch gaye! Ab bas apna bag mil jaye...

84
00:09:13,000 --> 00:09:16,000
Umer: Woh raha — mera blue bag!

85
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:26,000
Umer: Dosto, yeh hai Islamabad International Airport!

86
00:09:26,200 --> 00:09:29,800
Umer: Kitna bada, saaf aur khoobsurat hai — maza aa gaya!

87
00:09:30,600 --> 00:09:34,600
Umer: Bahar se dekhiye — Islamabad airport ki lehrati hui chhat!

88
00:09:38,600 --> 00:09:42,200
Umer: Meri Corolla Grande parking mein khadi hai — chalo!

89
00:09:50,600 --> 00:09:54,000
Umer: Bag andar, seat belt laga li — Bismillah!

90
00:09:58,600 --> 00:10:03,000
Umer: Ab seedha Murree Road ki taraf — Islamabad ki sair!

91
00:10:08,600 --> 00:10:12,600
Umer: Yeh hai Murree Road — upar Metro Bus chal rahi hai!

92
00:10:24,000 --> 00:10:28,600
Umer: Dekhiye dosto — Islamabad sirf hara bhara nahi, yahan bari bari imaratein aur malls bhi hain!

93
00:10:29,000 --> 00:10:32,600
Umer: Aur har jagah Aprox AI aur Next Group ke banners!

94
00:10:38,600 --> 00:10:42,200
Umer: Signal laal — zebra crossing par log guzar rahe hain.

95
00:10:52,200 --> 00:10:56,200
Umer: Aage Margalla Hills — aur phir Faisal Masjid!

96
00:10:59,100 --> 00:11:02,900
Umer: Islamabad ki sarkein — saaf, hari bhari, aur peeche Margalla!

97
00:11:04,600 --> 00:11:08,600
Umer: Aur yeh hai Faisal Masjid... SubhanAllah.

98
00:11:15,100 --> 00:11:18,100
Umer: Dosto, Karachi se Islamabad ka safar mukammal hua!

99
00:11:18,100 --> 00:11:20,900
Umer: Video pasand aaye to like, share aur subscribe zaroor karein.

100
00:11:20,900 --> 00:11:23,400
Umer: Agli episode mein milte hain — Allah Hafiz!
